Here is an example of the PHP code you can use:
$equation = "6*7"; // or any equation that equals 42
$evaluated = eval("return $equation;");
$sum = array_sum(str_split($evaluated));
// map sum to corresponding book
$book_mapping = array(
    1 => array("title" => "Ender's Game", "author" => "Orson Scott Card"),
    2 => array("title" => "Dune", "author" => "Frank Herbert"),
    3 => array("title" => "The Hitchhiker's Guide to the Galaxy", "author" => "Douglas Adams"),
    // add more books and mappings as needed
);
