We then train the agent using Q-learning for 10,000 episodes. In each episode, we start from a random state and take actions until we reach the goal state. We update the Q-matrix using the Q-learning update rule.
Finally, we test the agent by starting from the initial state and taking the best action at each step until we reach the goal state. We print the sequence of states visited by the agent.
